<!--    SAP Security Baseline requirement:          OBSCNT-A: Obsolete Clients in ABAP
        Security level:                             Standard (Level 2)

        Policy Version:     Date:           Owner:          Comment:
        v2.6.0              2026-03-17      XX-SER-SECCHK   original for GA
 -->
